{
  "id": "l3-ad-endcard",
  "title": "Logo end card for ads",
  "request": "animate our logo for the end of our ads, keep it clean and on brand, 3 sec",
  "uploads": "One logo file: the word FERN in a thin green serif font with a small leaf replacing the dot-less space above the letter E. Brand colors: forest green and cream.",
  "story_path": "current/tests/creative-director/outputs/gpt/l3-ad-endcard/v3a.md",
  "chunks_path": "current/tests/creative-director/outputs/gpt/l3-ad-endcard/v5b.md",
  "story": "For the final three seconds of the ad, a clean cream background holds the FERN logo. The word FERN fades gently into view in its original thin, forest-green serif lettering. The small leaf above the E appears a moment later, completing the supplied design without changing its shape or placement. The finished logo rests still for the closing beat—quiet, fresh, and polished, with no additional text or embellishment.",
  "chunks": "## Baseline — first frame\n\n- **Purpose and duration:** Clean, on-brand logo animation occupying the final **3.00 seconds** of the ad.\n- **Environment:** Full-frame, solid cream background using the brand’s cream color. No scenery or other objects.\n- **Characters:** None.\n- **Logo asset:** Use the supplied FERN logo without redrawing or altering it. Preserve its original thin, forest-green serif lettering and the small leaf’s exact shape, size, and placement above the E.\n- **Placement:** Center the complete logo composition in the frame. Its position, scale, spacing, and proportions remain fixed throughout.\n- **Initial visibility:** Both the word FERN and the leaf start at 0% opacity. The cream background is fully visible.\n- **Products and other objects:** None.\n- **Time of day:** Not applicable; graphic end card.\n- **Lighting:** Flat and even; no shadows, highlights, or lighting effects.\n- **Palette:** Brand cream and the supplied logo’s forest green only.\n- **Style:** Minimal, quiet, fresh, and polished. No additional text, embellishment, camera movement, or logo deformation.\n- **Audio:** Preserve any existing ad audio; add no music, voiceover, or sound effects.\n- **Aspect ratio:** Match the parent ad; no aspect ratio was specified.\n\n## Chunk 1 — Word fades in\n\n- **Quote:** “For the final three seconds of the ad, a clean cream background holds the FERN logo. The word FERN fades gently into view in its original thin, forest-green serif lettering.”\n- **Signpost:** “For the final three seconds of the ad”\n- **Changes:**\n  - Word FERN opacity: 0% → 100%, with a gentle fade.\n- **Type:** continuous\n- **Duration:** 1.20 seconds — 0.00–1.20\n- **On-screen text and audio:** The supplied logo word “FERN” becomes visible.\n- **Depends on:** none; starts from the baseline.\n\n## Chunk 2 — Leaf completes the logo\n\n- **Quote:** “The small leaf above the E appears a moment later, completing the supplied design without changing its shape or placement.”\n- **Signpost:** “a moment later”\n- **Changes:**\n  - Leaf opacity: 0% → 100%. Hold it invisible for the first 0.15 seconds of this chunk, then fade it in over 0.35 seconds.\n- **Type:** continuous\n- **Duration:** 0.50 seconds — 1.20–1.70\n- **Depends on:** Chunk 1\n\n## Chunk 3 — Closing hold\n\n- **Quote:** “The finished logo rests still for the closing beat—quiet, fresh, and polished, with no additional text or embellishment.”\n- **Signpost:** “for the closing beat”\n- **Changes:** None; hold the completed logo’s end state.\n- **Type:** continuous\n- **Duration:** 1.30 seconds — 1.70–3.00\n- **Depends on:** Chunk 2",
  "spec": {
